{
  "name": "诸神之盔 Helm of the Gods",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/equipment/head/helm-barbute-horned-gold-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID:15.6pt none\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">戴上这个头盔的时候，你可以知道在你<span>30</span>尺范围内是否有天界生物或邪魔，以及该生物所在的位置，前提是该生物不处于全掩护状态。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">每当你戴着头盔完成长休息时，你可以向诸神之盔表上所列的一个神明祈祷，并将所列的法术储存在头盔中，取代任何已经储存在那里的法术。法术的豁免<span>DC</span>为<span>13</span>。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">头盔有<span>3</span>发充能。要从头盔中施放一个法术，你必须消耗<span>1</span>发充能，头盔每天黎明时恢复<span>1d3</span>发充能。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">法术列表：</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.IuzXxwP3EhWGhtXC]{防护善恶}（雅睿欧斯<span>Athreos</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.FbxdKcDpSPWuGTLA]{庇护术}（厄芳拉<span>Ephara</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Fl4lOWHo82WLp3g7]{造成轻伤}（厄睿柏斯<span>Erebos</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.PHYXwNkXSdJjDCSD]{曳光弹}（赫利欧德<span>Heliod</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.eatsvLyUqyzEFzCv]{英勇气概}（伊洛安斯<span>Iroas</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.AmuFE4xAoWlzjjQU]{神莓}（卡拉美特拉<span>Karametra</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Nnlg7rIKGf7VMWRl]{雷鸣斩}（刻拉诺斯<span>Keranos</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.NZ4JOGBMJzeCKT5O]{纠缠术}（克洛缇丝<span>Klothys</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.j8wwbcc1tlY9hLRf]{不谐低语}（克罗芬斯<span>Kruphix </span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Qh8PTvCxR44isqVO]{炼狱叱喝}（墨癸斯<span>Mogis</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.sLkNbDcU39qcVt14]{妖火}（倪勒娅<span>Nylea</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.I1C2EQxwynPd7dOC]{次级复原术}（芳瑞卡<span>Pharika</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.QFBZcGORjnBRgAYo]{魅惑人类}（斐纳克<span>Phenax</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.73yB6CHxGk3Np5ME]{炽焰斩}（普罗烽斯<span>Purphoros</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.tyshE8ZcV1Xniej3]{鉴定术}（塔萨<span>Thassa</span>）</p></div>",
